# sandbox-openbao, read by sandbox-openbao.container via EnvironmentFile=.
#
# systemd env-file syntax: KEY=value, no quoting, `#` starts a comment.

# Dev mode, so the root token can be pinned: the devbox, the egress and the
# acceptance checks all hardcode it. It lives in this file on purpose — the
# alternative, a token the user has to read out of the container's logs, is one
# more thing to forget. The trade is recorded in audit S1 and
# sandbox/openbao/README.md.
BAO_DEV_ROOT_TOKEN_ID=sandbox-root-token
